    </dashboard>
    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Methodology'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/BNPLDownstreamImpact/Methodology?rev=' id='Methodology' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/BNPLDownstreamImpact' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_6' value='top' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1300' minheight='800' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98000' id='3' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98770' x='615' y='1000'>
            <zone fixed-size='100' h='12500' id='5' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98770' x='615' y='1000'>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='12500' id='6' type-v2='text' w='79540' x='615' y='1000'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#050038' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='20'>BNPL - Downstream impact methodology</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='242' h='12500' id='7' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/DH_Fintech_Full_RGB.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='19230' x='80155' y='1000'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='535' h='66875' id='15' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98770' x='615' y='13500'>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='66875' id='8' type-v2='text' w='77770' x='615' y='13500'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='14'>Objective: </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Calculation of the BNPL impact on user behaviour in terms of orders and GMV.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='14'>Methodology:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>We create an artificial control group using </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Propensity Score matching</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> (as we do not have an actual control group), to remove self selection bias and calculate the product real impact.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>What is the Propensity Score:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> The probability that the user chooses the treatment (BNPL adoption) given the covariates (the properties used for matching). This is estimated using linear regression and derived using </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>monthly GMV</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> and </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>monthly order frequency</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> per user in months (-1,-2,-3) before adoption as properties.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>We then calculate the propensity score for:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>1- BNPL adopters in a certain month</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>2- Users who never used BNPL (users granted BNPL and not adopted or all UAE active users in these months) -&gt; Candidates for the control group</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>We have matched the groups on propensity score (one to one matching), to get a control group which is matching to the adopters group in behaviour three months pre adoption, in order to be sure that the change in the behaviour post adoption is caused by BNPL.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Metric aggregation: </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>we suggest a minimum of 3 months of post-adoption data (which can customised in the dashboard) to minimize the immediate adoption uplift bias, usually higher on the +1 month. </run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='66875' id='16' param='Image/methodology.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='21000' x='78385' y='13500'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='102' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='84000' id='101' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='84000' x='8000' y='8000'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='12500' id='6' type-v2='text' w='79540' x='615' y='1000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#050038' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='20'>BNPL - Downstream impact methodology</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='92' h='12500' id='7' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/DH_Fintech_Full_RGB.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='19230' x='80155' y='1000'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='66875' id='8' type-v2='text' w='77770' x='615' y='13500'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='14'>Objective: </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Calculation of the BNPL impact on user behaviour in terms of orders and GMV.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='14'>Methodology:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>We create an artificial control group using </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Propensity Score matching</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> (as we do not have an actual control group), to remove self selection bias and calculate the product real impact.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>What is the Propensity Score:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> The probability that the user chooses the treatment (BNPL adoption) given the covariates (the properties used for matching). This is estimated using linear regression and derived using </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>monthly GMV</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> and </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>monthly order frequency</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> per user in months (-1,-2,-3) before adoption as properties.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>We then calculate the propensity score for:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>1- BNPL adopters in a certain month</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>2- Users who never used BNPL (users granted BNPL and not adopted or all UAE active users in these months) -&gt; Candidates for the control group</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>We have matched the groups on propensity score (one to one matching), to get a control group which is matching to the adopters group in behaviour three months pre adoption, in order to be sure that the change in the behaviour post adoption is caused by BNPL.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Metric aggregation: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>we suggest a minimum of 3 months of post-adoption data (which can customised in the dashboard) to minimize the immediate adoption uplift bias, usually higher on the +1 month. </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='66875' id='16' is-fixed='true' param='Image/methodology.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='21000' x='78385' y='13500'>
                  <zone-style>
